# KB maintenance

## Suite library requirements (23 October 2026)

Publish docs/(App Name) KB Library.docx with app name, approved logo and app colours
on every page. Retain legacy KB Library.docx links until consumers are migrated.
Link the main-branch TMApps Master KB Library on page one once published; never
claim an unpublished document is available. Keep stable KB IDs, working index and
cross-reference links, setup, user guides, actual errors/resolutions and escalation.
Include explicit offline/online coverage. Use real sanitized screenshots. Render
and visually inspect every changed Word page before upload. Keep in-app Help,
optional KB search results, Wiki articles and the main KB registry aligned.
